window.products.push({"id":253019,"name":"Chenille Plush Extra Long Door Mat Runner Long Machine Washable Non-Slip Door Mat, Bath Mat, Bedroom Rug, with Water Absorbent Quick Drying Microfiber","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KThO7KTKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3 LAYER LUXURY! 1 INCH CHENILLE PILE : Our mats made are made of 100% ultra-soft 1 inch tall plush chenille microfiber which keeps your feet nice and warm, your floors dry, and ensures you dont slip after your bath or shower. We use a machine washable PVC backing for long lasting use and minimum fiber loss, a 6mm thick foam layer for anti fatigue, and a non slip underside for extra safety. Color Code 18-0601 TPX. FOAM ANTI FATIGUE LAYER :) A 6mm sponge foam layer inside relieves pressure and fatigue on your feet, and keeps your feet insulated from the cold floor. Use our mat as a nice cushion and avoid fatigue when brushing your teeth, shaving and more! ANTI SLIP SAFETY LAYER: Make sure you don’t slip on your tile with our slip safe bath mat rug. An anti slip PVC coating underneath our mat helps keep it firmly in place. WARNING: To ensure that the rug does not slip, clean the floor and let it dry before placing the bath rug down! MACHINE WASH AND DRY: Our mats are easy to clean, just toss them in the wash! DIRECTIONS : Machine wash warm on permanent press with like colors and tumble dry low. Do not bleach, iron or dry clean. The colors will stay vibrant after many washes! ABOUT US: We know our mats and rugs! We work hand in hand with our factory to use the highest quality materials so that we only deliver top notch products. Need Help? Please contact us and we will help you with anything you need!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KThO7KTKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAYSHINE","source_asin":"B0BN9529JL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN9529JL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN9529JL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":253020,"name":"Jimi Hendrix Poster - Digital Portrait - Geometric WPAP Inspired Print - Gift for Dad Brother (11x14)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-MiO2eXsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is one more poster in our WPAP inspired collection of home wall prints. WPAP stands for Wedha's Pop Art Portrait and unites modern digital portraits that employ surreal colors, stark contrast and geometry. This Jimi Hendrix print will stand out in your collection of wall posters thanks to its rich colors and modern stylization. But it’s also valuable because of the man himself, Jimi. The poster will mean a lot to people who’re still listening to the recordings of his performances. Talents can’t die in our hearts, right? We suggest this poster as a gift idea. Of course, you’ll need to be familiar with the presentee’s interests. If you know exactly how much they adore Jimi Hendrix, your gift is very likely to appeal to them. Please keep in mind that this is an unframed print. It measures 11 x 14in, and it mixes well with other posters from the same collection that you can see in our shop.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-MiO2eXsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PGbureau","source_asin":"B07YCG63LX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YCG63LX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YCG63LX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
