window.products.push({"id":253057,"name":"HARMONY 1500 Air Purifier for Home Large Room with H13 True HEPA Air Filter, Quiet Air Cleaner for Allergens, Pets, Smoke, Removes 99.9% of Dust, Mold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p15CyaXJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Purify your air – Our 4-in-1 filtration system completely replaces the air in large rooms up to 1500 sq ft every hour. It removes large particles like pet hair and floating debris, captures small corrosive particles and targets pollen, dust, pet dander, VOC’s, tobacco smoke and odors. Sleek design – the HSE1500 serves your home while blending in with your décor. It’s consumer preferred design and modern white finish help your air purifier fit anywhere in your home, bedroom, room. H13 True HEPA – H13 True HEPA filter captures 99.97% of particles down to 0.3 microns. Both an air cleaner and odor eliminator, our air purifier also features activated-carbon filter that absorbs odors, smoke, and gases. With a state-of-the-art fan and motor, enjoy clean air delivered quietly and efficiently. Smart air purifier – In AUTO mode, a smart air quality sensor detects pollutants in your air, adjusting the fan speed in real-time and can enter an energy-saving ECO mode.  A sleek digital display on the unit reveals your air quality level, so you always know what you’re breathing. What you get – Smart air purifier, H13 True HEPA filter, manual, 3-year warranty, award-winning customer support 7 days a week, and the peace of mind that comes from a trusted American brand quality tested and backed by CARB, ETL, and Energy Star.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p15CyaXJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HATHASPACE","source_asin":"B0C2JF5179","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2JF5179","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2JF5179","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
