window.products.push({"id":253219,"name":"OXO Good Grips Big Button Soap Dispenser","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514r8p5N7sL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"OXO's stainless steel easy press dispenser offers an easy-dispensing mechanism combined with elegant design. A non-slip top button makes it easy to squirt hand soap, lotion or dish soap using one hand and the extended spout easily dispenses onto a sponge or directly into the sink. The brushed stainless steel body features a non-slip foot to keep the pump dispenser stable during use and a clear window to show the contents. When it's time to refill, simply Unscrew the top and pour into the wide opening.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514r8p5N7sL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OXO","source_asin":"B071RCKMMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253219","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071RCKMMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071RCKMMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":253220,"name":"ValleyDesignsND Man Cave Fathers Shop Garage Dad Sign Acrylic Lighted Edge Lit LED Sign Desk Style, or Flat to The Wall Mount 11\" - 21\" 9 Foot Cord Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619B7HmhRiL._AC_SL1009_.jpg","description":"Welcome to the home of the ORIGINAL ValleyDesignsND acrylic designs! No chains, No suction cups, No heavy wood boxes, just a very lightweight acrylic sign completely detailed & made in wall or desk models.  Made right here in the USA, our signs are full size, made by experienced \"signtists\" and expert craftsmen with over a decade of experience. We use the highest quality, thick rigid crystal clear acrylic, with the highest detail possible.  Style/Size 1: Our 11\" wide desk model varies in height depending on the object pictured. It has a 12\" wide black reflective acrylic mirror base, and an AC adapter. Our optional external battery box can be used for short term use such as shows & events.  Style/Size 2: This wall model is 11\" wide, and varies in height depending on the object pictured, and has a thin black strip on the lighting edge that holds the LEDs. This model includes an AC adapter and lightweight brushed aluminum standoffs for mounting. An external battery box can be used for short term use like at car shows and events.  Style/Size 3 & 4: Both styles 1 & 2, desk & wall models also come in our awesome 21\" wide style.  If you do not see the design you are looking for, be sure to search by model name, not the make, or feel free to ask. We always have models not listed yet. We have sizes up to 4' x 2'. Please feel free to contact us if needed, we will be glad to help.  Our available colors are: Red Blue Green Orange Turquoise White & Purple ......or You can choose our amazing pro model color changing option. This option has a remote control with 20 pre-defined colors, or, you can program your own custom colors. In addition, you'll have control of the brightness, speed of color changes, strobes, fades, transitions, and much more! You can also save and retrieve 3 of your custom color settings.  You can purchase the short term battery box in our Store under VVD External Battery.  PROUDLY MADE IN THE USA!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619B7HmhRiL._AC_SL1009_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ValleyDesignsND","source_asin":"B07JG8C55G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JG8C55G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JG8C55G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
