window.products.push({"id":253258,"name":"Jura E8 Coffee & Beverage Center Bundle Set With Milk Container","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41yng5CGhLL._AC_.jpg","description":"This set includes: -Jura Glass Milk container, clear (72570). -Jura CLEARYL Blue Water Filter Cartdrige (71445). -Jura Decalcifying/Descaling Tablets (66281) (9 Tablets). -Jura Cleaning Tablets for all Jura Automatic Coffee Centers (64308). Top innovation: P.E.P.: Pulse Extraction Process JURA’s new E line is revolutionizing the enjoyment of coffee in every aspect.  The Pulse Extraction Process (P.E.P.) is the only process of its kind in the world.  It optimizes the extraction time and guarantees the very best aroma even for short specialty coffees. The secret of exceptional coffee lies in the preparation.  JURA has 100% perfected the espresso brewing process, allowing the E8 to make specialty coffees to professional barista standard.  The six-level AromaG3 grinder ensures that the coffee is optimally ground. It always grinds the beans fresh, quickly yet gently to preserve the aroma.  The variable brewing unit has a capacity of 5 to 16 grams and ensures optimum brewing conditions at all times.  Intelligent Water System for automatic filter detection CLEARYL water filters supply perfect water quality for the best possible flavor.  They also protect the coffee machine against limescale and remove substances that could impair flavor and aroma (such as heavy metals or chlorine) from the water. JURA is setting new standards in very simple operation. For those who like to make their favorite coffee quickly, the E8 is ideal. The buttons for the espresso, coffee, cappuccino and milk foam functions are all positioned on the front for maximum convenience.  The E8 can even prepare two espressi or coffees at the same time.  Thanks to the modern TFT color display, operating the machine is self-explanatory.  The large bean container has a capacity of 10 ounces for uninterrupted coffee enjoyment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41yng5CGhLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jura","source_asin":"B073XTP59P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073XTP59P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073XTP59P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
