window.products.push({"id":253276,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, 120PCS 6.3\" Non-stick Air Fryer Liners, Oil Resistant, Waterproof Parchment Baking Paper for Cooking Roasting Microw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ah1AHqpnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥Keep Your Air Fryer Clean: These air fryer liners are must have if you hate cleaning after baking. Disposable paper liners can effectively keep food residue away from fryer, heightened edge of 4.5cm can protect the side of fryers and prevent food from sticking to them. 🔥Healthy and Reliable Material: Air fryer disposable liners are made of natural wood pulp, can withstand temperatures up to 428℉ and it has no effect on the taste of the food. Food-grade silicone coating makes it waterproof and oil-resistant, the food will not stick to the liner surface and be damaged even though with rich sauce on, can better protect the cookware. 🔥Each baking paper figures a bowl shape with 6.3” in bottom width and 1.85” in edge height. PLEASE MEASURE YOUR AIR FRYER BASKET BOTTOM BEFORE PURCHASE! 120 pieces in one pack are enough for a long time daily uses. 🔥Round parchment paper can also be used in frying pan, microwave, oven and insta-pot. No mess, no fuss with these liners whether you’re baking, roasting or frying. In a case where you’re cooking something far messy and greasy, doubling the liner would be advised. Definitely worth the minimal cost for such a time saver! ❗❗❗Note: Do not put air fryer liners disposable paper without food during preheating. Hot air can easy blowing the lightweight paper into the heating element and burn.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ah1AHqpnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOWINGO","source_asin":"B0BNQ11DPT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNQ11DPT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNQ11DPT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
