window.products.push({"id":253278,"name":"CordaRoy's Chenille Bean Bag Chair, Convertible Chair Folds from Bean Bag to Bed, As Seen on Shark Tank, Espresso - Queen Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":247.18,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g5yrKWGSL._AC_SL1423_.jpg","description":"With CordaRoy's Chenille Bean Bag Chair, a great night's sleep is in the bag! As seen on Shark Tank, this is an ideal bean bag chair for adults and children alike. The fun seating and sleeping solution is perfect for your for your living room, guest room, kid's room, basement, and more! The convertible chair changes from big bean bag chair to queen-size bean bag bed in no time! To turn the chair into a bed, simply unzip the safe-lock zipper, remove the cover, and flip inner cushion. Fold and slide the cushion into cover to convert back to the original bean bag shape. So easy, the kids can do it! CordaRoy's Chenille Bean Bag Chair is made of the highest quality materials for your comfort. The super plush, dimpled microfiber cover is durable for a lifetime of use while remaining luxuriously soft. The espresso brown color looks great with any decor style. When it is time for a refresh, simply toss the cover in the washer and dryer for a convenient clean. The fabric guaranteed to remain soft no matter how many times you wash! At CordaRoy's, we use furniture-gradefoam that is extremely long lasting yet soft and supportive. This means the inside of your convertible chair is made with the highest quality foam that provides conforming comfort whether you are reading, watching a movie, sleeping, or just hanging out. CordaRoy's Chenille Bean Bag Chair is compressed for convenient shipping straight to your doorstep. To set up your CordaRoy’s product, carefully remove the bed from the plastic and place inside the chair cover, ideally as soon as possible so the filling can decompress as intended. Please note that while the foam bed may look flat at first, it will expand within 3-7 days depending on the product size. Help activate and break apart the foam by fluffing, massaging, and scrubbing together the lumps from the outside. Use as normal for the next few days, and watch how your CordaRoy's bed continues to break down and get softer! The convertible chair comes complete with (1) Queen Chair Cover and (1) Queen Bed Insert, everything you need to get comfortable right away. Bean bag chair seats 2 adults (48\" wide). Queen bed sleeps 2 adults (60\" x 80\" x 10\").","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g5yrKWGSL._AC_SL1423_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CordaRoy's","source_asin":"B0BTNBCRBW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTNBCRBW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTNBCRBW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
