window.products.push({"id":253423,"name":"NEW TUPPERWARE MODULAR MATES GARLIC STORAGE 2.3 KG (One Pack), BLACK, GREEN","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31xcMTEJ72L._AC_.jpg","description":"The small warehouse complements the onion warehouse and the potato warehouse and thus ensures optimal and \"species-appropriate\" storage of the vegetables that are used every day. It likes to house garlic or smaller amounts of onions. It can be stacked on the onion or potato storage and, thanks to the dark but ventilated storage, offers an optimal climate: not too dry, so that the tubers cannot dry out, the low incidence of light minimizes germination. The Small Storage is ideal for 1- or 2-person households for storing onions, for larger households it is ideal for garlic: The 2.3 l content offers space for approx. 1 kg of onions or 8-10 bulbs of garlic . Dimensions: Small storage: L 21.5 × W 18.5 × H 11.7 cm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31xcMTEJ72L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEW TUPPERWARE","source_asin":"B09ZL8S8ZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253423","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZL8S8ZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZL8S8ZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
