window.products.push({"id":253476,"name":"+ 360 S8 Robot Vacuum and Mop Cleaner, Customized Smart Mapping, LiDAR Navigation, 2700Pa Strong Suction, Self-Charging Work with Alexa/WiFi/APP, Idea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":329.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cFxRQgeiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Precision LiDAR Navigation】This sweep and mop robot vacuum is equipped with advanced LiDAR navigation, enables better accuracy, faster mapping, stronger performance in bypassing obstacles, and more efficient route planning, keeps cleaning effective all the time with SLAM navigation. 【Upgraded 2700Pa Super Strong Suction】With a max suction power of 2700 Pa and 4 adjustable suction levels: quiet/standard/powerful/max, S8 effectively gets rid of pet hair, dust, dirt and debris from hardfloor, tile and carpet. It can recognize carpet antomatically and boost suction power to the max for deep cleaning. 【Comprehensive App Control】This intelligent robot can be controlled with APP, you can see exact mopping and vacuuming routes, carpets location, set cleaning schedules, adjust suction power, water flow, cleaning sequencing, No-Go zones, invisible walls and more with 360 Robot App. Only compatible with 2.4Ghz Wi-Fi. 【Vacuum & Mop 2-in-1】360 S8 robot vacuum and mop combo could vacuum, mop or do both at the same time. The 3200mAh high capacity battery reaches up to 140 minutes of run-time. It is designed with self-charging function, will automatically returns to the charging dock when battery is lower than 20%, and after fully charged, it will continue cleaning from where it left off. 【Multi-floor Map Management】The S8 vacuum provides a multi-floor map management through 360 Robot App, it can save 3 maps plus 7 recent maps, you can customize cleaning area conveniently with the APP. It also comes with anti-drop sensors to prevent it from falling downstairs. 【Tips for Carpets Cleaning】360 S8 robot vacuum is suitable for low pile and medium pile carpets within 0.79in (2cm) thickness; and if you want to vacuum carpets, please take away mop bracket in case it stucks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cFxRQgeiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"+ 360","source_asin":"B09YM6GVJ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YM6GVJ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YM6GVJ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":253477,"name":"ALASKA BEAR Luxurious 25 Momme Silk Pillowcase, 100% Mulberry Silk Pillow Case Cover, Standard (1, Ivory(Natural Undyed White))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kYmZcWfaL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"Alaska Bear-- Enhance your Life Washing and Care Instructions: Hand wash in cold or lukewarm water with mild detergent. Do not soak dark-colored silk for more than three minutes. To help retain color, add a few drops of distilled white vinegar to final rinse. As silk becomes more delicate when wet, do not twist or wring. Hang dry. Do not dry in direct sunlight. Though hand-washing is preferable, you may machine wash in cold water on the gentlest cycle with mild detergent. Do not bleach. Wash silk separately from other items. Hang dry. Do not dry in direct sunlight. Machine drying is not recommended.  Wrinkles in silk should disappear with time, and so ironing is not recommended. If you must, only iron the reverse side of the damp silk with your iron set on the lowest setting.  Please enjoy your mulberry silk product, which brings a feeling of cool, relaxing luxury to every night of sleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kYmZcWfaL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALASKA BEAR","source_asin":"B01MFFAQCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253477","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MFFAQCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MFFAQCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":253478,"name":"TJM Wine Tumbler with Lid 2 Pack 9 oz Steel Stemless Wine Glass Tumbler with Removable Wooden Coasters for Beer Coffee Champagne Office Outdoors（Dark ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vF0kGjQlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Staine Steel Wine Glasses Tumbler with Lid and Removable Wooden Coasters High Quality Material The cup is made of stainless steel, grade 304 18/8 stainless steel.Adopt concave drawing technique.It is strong and does not break easily.Cup body spray technology, over time, the surface of the cup will not drop paint. Appropriate Capacity Appropriate 9oz cup capacity, you can drink wine, beer, coffee, tea in your leisure time or at work. Double Layer Structure Insulation and Cooling Effect Double vacuum insulated wine glasses can keep your hot or cold drinks for hours.Vacuum seal area outside the copper to increase insulation and sweat resistance, prevent burns, there will be no condensation outside the cup. Wooden Coasters With detachable wooden coasters to reduce friction with the table and prevent the bottom of the cup from fraying,It can also be placed gently on the table to reduce noise. Note: coasters are wooden needs to pay attention to moisture, should be placed in a dry place, as far as possible not to touch the water. Design Unique cup body design is very small and lovely, and spray design can prevent the cup body color.There are a variety of colors for you to choose. Place and Gift unique and original wine glasses tumbler that you can give as gifts to family members or friends who like to drink.It is a birthday, Christmas, valentine's day, mother's day or father's day gift, will show your excellent taste!There are many colors to choose from, dark blue, pink, white and blue.Spray high quality will not lose paint for a long time.You can drink with this cup with your friends, family at home, camping, hiking, even in the car.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vF0kGjQlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TJM","source_asin":"B086VBNXMB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086VBNXMB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086VBNXMB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
