window.products.push({"id":253536,"name":"Cake Decorating Kit, 65PCS Cupcake Decorating Kit with Storage Box and Piping Bags and Tips Set, Cookie Decorating Supplies Kit with Silicone Cupcake ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cXqpxKmfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤️Perfect 62PCS Kit for Beginners and Pro. HKNMTT cake decorating kit feature all the tools you need to make cupcake and cookie, from silicone cupcake liners, piping bags and tips to decorating utensils. These cake decorating supplies come in an elegant sturdy storage box, a perfect gift set for kids, cupcakes and icing cookie DIY lovers. Suitable for halloween, Christmas, Kid's Parties, Valentines, Easter, Graduation, Housewarming, Anniversary, and Mother's Day. ✅Food Grade High-Quality Supplies. Include 2 * reusable silicone TPU Piping bags and 12 * silicone cupcake cups, 2 * Bag Ties, 20 * disposable Bags, 11 * Icing Tips, 4 * Couplers, 4 * Sealing Clips, Brush, Angled Spatula, Flower Lifter, Flower Nail, Tri-Color Coupler, Single Bag Coupler.All products are manufactured by famous brand factories, with super high workmanship and quality, you will feel extremely safe while making food. 👍Piping Bags and Tips Set for Easy Switching. With durable converters, the piping bags tips can be easily switched. Equipped with three-color coupler support you make colorful cake flowers and cupcakes. The Piping Bags of non-slip exterior and soft silicone material allow you to hold it more comfortably, easy to use and clean. Meanwhile, we've also prepared 20 food-grade plastic piping bags that are thick enough to withstand the pressure of squeezing and frosting without bursting or leaking. ✨Cupcake decorating supplies have 11 shapes of icing piping nozzles to help you use your imagination to design your cake! Includes 5 russian piping tips coupler and 6 cake decorating tips, all made from food grade 304 stainless steel. Our piping nozzles are designed in one piece, which is easy to clean and will not deform. Very durable and rust free, BPA free and child safe. 🧁Cupcake set including 12 BPA Free Reusable Food Grade Silicone Cake Baking Cups. High temperature resistant and non-stick, easy to bake and keep things in good shape. Just soak them in water for a while, then rinse them off with water. They can also be washed in the dishwasher. Includes 6 colors: pink, orange, yellow, green, blue and purple. Perfect for making tarts, baking muffins, preparing frozen treats, cupcakes, pastries and bread, desserts on baking sheets, snack cups and more. ✂️Cake Flower Nail and Scissor are tools for cupcake decorating kits that are suitable for parties, weddings, flower pastes and syrups. Perfect for royal icing roses and florets. It is easy to transfer flowers from nails to cake without damage and the shape is designed to prevent hands from touching the cake, perfect for beginners. 🌹To avoid losing your icing bags and tips set accessories, we have carefully prepared durable and convenient storage boxes for all the included baking tools and accessories. Keep your kitchen tidy while protecting your cake tools and increasing their durability. 🥳Comes with silicone icing bag ties and plastic sealing clips for durability, sturdiness and reusability. Compared with silicone icing bag ties, plastic sealing clips can quickly and easily clamp the piping bag, which is very suitable for disposable piping bags. They are must-have decoration accessories for cupcakes, cookies, candy and pastries for cooking, bakery and parties. 👨‍👨‍👧‍👦Getting children engaged in the kitchen from a young age will give them a better understanding of food groups and how to make balanced choices. Meanwhile, cooking increases self-confidence in children who feel that they are achieving more and more each day. Start to spend time in the kitchen with your kids to foster their interest in food and cooking that will last for life! 😆100% WARRANTY Support. 30-day free return and 12-month warranty, 24/7 after-sales service team, we are so confident that you'll absolutely love The HKNMTT COOKIE DECORATING KIT. Try it without risk right now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cXqpxKmfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HKNMTT","source_asin":"B0C6DKFZ8F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6DKFZ8F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6DKFZ8F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
