window.products.push({"id":253621,"name":"Custom Throw Blanket with Photos Collage, Soft Sherpa Fleece Customized Blanket with Pictures and Text, Personalized Blanket Gifts for Kids Family Fri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bKfamShxS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for a gift with special meaning? If so, don't miss our personalized custom blankets. Our customizable blankets can preserve the warm and memorable people and things in your life and give her/him a surprise! FUNCTION: Sherpa Fleece Fabric Custom Blanket - Microfiber Sherpa Fleece Fabric, keep you warm. Super Soft and Super Warm Personalized Sherpa Throw Blanket - No Shed, Feel Smooth, Soft and Comfortable. Durable Sherpa Customized Bed Blanket - Long lasting Bright Colors, Does Not Fade. Washable Sherpa Custom Blanket - Machine Cold Wash. CUSTOMIZATION PROCESS 1. Choose size and style 2. Click \"Customize Now\" 3. Choose the custom style you like 4. Upload your image or text 5. Upload pictures larger than 1MB 6. Submit and complete customization THROW BLANKET SIZE 1. The 40\"x50\" size is suitable for infants and young children, can be used as stroller blanket, Knee blanket, car blanket.etc 2. The 50\" x 60\" size is suitable for kids, boys, girls, can be used ad nap blanket, travel blanket, picnic blanket.etc 3. The 50\" x 80\" size is suitable for teen students, can be used ad dormitory blanket, office blanket, TV blanket.etc 4. The 60\" x 80\" size is suitable for adults, can be used ad bed blanket, couch blanket, sofa blanket.etc Package: 1 x Sherpa Blanket Cleaning Tips: 1. Wash with good quality detergent, the water temperature should be around 35 °C. 2, the blanket should be aired frequently during use, and gently tapped, so that the sweat, dust and dander adhered to the blanket are removed, keeping the blanket clean and dry. 3, the blankets need to be dried before storage, and then sealed with plastic bags, stored in a dry cabinet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bKfamShxS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Roses Garden","source_asin":"B097QX9KMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097QX9KMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097QX9KMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
