window.products.push({"id":253668,"name":"LeadYuantop Electric Magnetic Stirring Coffee Cup, 18 oz Electric Mixing Mug, Automatic Funny Self Mixing Cup, Stainless Steel Travel Cup for Chocolat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YVBKm0tnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Quality Material】Electric mixing mug is made of 304 stainless steel and food grade ABS plastic materials, high temperature resistance, rust-free. The lid was made of silicone, Durable and wear-resistant, odorless, bottom non-slip coaster for silent placement. Auto magnetic stirring coffee cup double-layer design of the cup body, prevent heat loss. Will not burn your hands when the boiling water is poured into the cup, large capacity, have a hot drink anytime. 【Magnetic Stirring】With premium magnetic capsules, high-speed motor can quickly rotate the water flow, low noise, uniform mixing. Self stirring cup can quickly magnetize natural water, long-term drinking of magnetized water helps nutrient absorption, improves gastrointestinal function, promotes body metabolism, improves immunity. Self mixing cup requires 2 AAA batteries, but we do not provide them. 【Easy to Operate】You just need to put in ground coffee to electric mixing cup and then pour in boiling water to tumbler, simply press the button once to start the automatic stirring, press it again to stop the stirring. Using the principle of physical stirring, the temperature can be quickly dissipated while stirring quickly , no need to stir with a spoon, free your hands and save time and effort, it is easy to operation for the elderly and children. 【Easy to Clean】The automatic mixing coffee cup is lightweight, easy to carry and magnetic capsule is detachable. It can be used as a normal cup for drinking if you do not need stirring function. It only needs to be cleaned with clean water, which is easy to clean, but do not use the dishwasher or soak to clean. 【Wide Application】Suitable for coffee, tea, hot chocolate, milk, protein shakes, lemonade, or other mix drinks. Suitable for various occasions-family, travel, office, business, picnic, Father's day, Mother's day, Christmas gift, Thanksgiving day, Halloween, Black Friday, this is the best gift for family, friends and colleagues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YVBKm0tnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LeadYuantop","source_asin":"B0BLYV46QM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLYV46QM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLYV46QM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
