window.products.push({"id":253762,"name":"YUXSM Dish Drying Mats for Kitchen Counter,Ultra Absorbent,Non-Slip,Heat Resistant Mat Kitchen Gadgets,Stone Dish Drying Mats，Rack Tableware Mat.(12x1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fqQ54VS7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"※[Widely Used]:Stone dish drainer mats efficiently and safely dry all utensils on the kitchen counter,as heat resistant pads,bottle pads,pet food non-slip pads,also suitable for bathroom,foot pads or bathroom supplies drying pads,etc.Such as dark drinks,coffee,wine,Do not place it on absorbent pads.Will leave marks if dripped on placemats. [Strong and durable diatomite]:Diatomite is a kind of siliceous rock, a kind of biogenic siliceous sedimentary rock. There are millions of small holes in the diatomite, which has strong adsorbability and absorbs excess water seepage. The diatomite cushion is hard and smooth, not as soft and fluffy as fabric or silica gel material. [Heat resistance and skid resistance]The dish drying mats has good water absorption and obvious heat insulation effect. he dish drying mats can be directly used on the table and can be used together with the baking tray, which has the cooling effect. The surface of baking pad is brushed and polished, with moderate friction and anti-skid design. [Marble style]:curved round corner, digital printing and dyeing, not easy to fade. Marble style tableware drying pad is more suitable for kitch en countertop. [Comfortable Experience]:Dishwashing is a part of life.Dish mats on the kitchen counter catch drips under the dish rack or place dishes directly on the mat to dry. Bring you a clean and comfortable experience.The kitchen drying pad can be directly washed with water,and it is best to place the drainboard pad upright in a ventilated place after use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fqQ54VS7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YUXSM","source_asin":"B0BHYT4588","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253762","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHYT4588","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHYT4588","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
