window.products.push({"id":253767,"name":"Christmas Table Runner , Genteen Polyester Christmas Tree Decor Table Runner Christmas Theme, Table Runner with Tassels Perfect Christmas Decor for Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SarS1VflL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester 🎅CHRISTMAS TABLE RUNNER - This table runner integrates the elements of the Christmas tree and adopts a wreath-like design pattern. It is simple but not out of style. There are not too many messy elements, but it greatly highlights the festive atmosphere. 🎄TABLE RUNNER WITH TASSELS - This christmas table runner is decorated with tassels and beautiful patterns. You can see the patterns from the opposite side, and you will find how magical and beautiful this handicraft is. It uses a highly intensive weaving technique instead of the rough weaving technique on the market. Our table runner also contains a sachet. 🎅QUALITY MATERIAL - This table runner is made of cotton and linen, which is very durable, not easy to wear and tear, easy to clean, ensure you to use for a long time. 🎄MULTIFUNCTIONAL UTILIZATION - This christmas table runner 70.8 inches long can decorate the dining, foyer, console or coffee tables while still showing off the surface of furniture, Use for bedroom, as a bed runner, let you feel happy and warm, makes a thoughtful and functional gift. 🎁GREAT GIFT- This table runner is perfect for home, party and dinner. It’s a great christmas gift for family and friends. Genteen only produce high quality product. Any question, please contact on us as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SarS1VflL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Genteen","source_asin":"B099NBHTT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099NBHTT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099NBHTT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":253768,"name":"Slushy Cup, Magic Slushy Maker Cup, TIK TOK Quick Frozen Magic Cup (Navy blue-500ML)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gtIG4ILBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Slushie Cup Height: 20.6 cm/8.11 inches, top diameter: 10.6 cm/4.17 inches, This ice cream maker has a built-in freezing liquid that transforms your favorite drinks (such as colas and juices) into refreshing ice cream in just seconds. The built-in freezing liquid and ingredients are exchanging heat and cold, making it delicious and safe to drink. It doesn't dilute the original flavor because it doesn't use a mixture of ice and juice to achieve a semi-frozen consistency. 2-IN-1 Slushy Maker Cup:Prepare a 2-in-1 spoon that can be used as a straw. No need to provide extra spoons or straws for your guests at your own slush party. Easily enjoy different flavors of slushies without the fuss. Easy to use: Place the smoothie cup in the freezer for 6 hours until the built-in freezing liquid freezes. (Freezing the white inner ice pack will make the process faster) Pour in your favorite drink, (be careful of the amount of liquid you use, do not exceed 2/3 of the cup to avoid overflowing.) , such as cola, juice, soda or alcoholic beverages (sugar-free beverages cannot be frozen), and squeeze. After a few minutes, remove this frozen magic cup and enjoy a smoothie. Perfect Gift: Slushie Maker No complicated steps, just put it in the freezer for 4-5 hours, then pour in any drink you like, squeeze it and you're ready for a delicious smoothie! Enjoy different flavors of slush parties that go perfectly with juice or soda, or you can add milk to make thick milkshakes or ice cream. Everyone can make smoothies at home and enjoy the process. Great creative gift for loved ones, family, friends, colleagues, classmates and kids. Tips: This amazing smoothie cup cannot be used with sugar-free drinks (sugar-free drinks can only be chilled, not made into smoothies); This frozen magic cup can be disassembled and reassembled, easy to clean and reuse. Can only be cleaned by hand, please do not touch the white ice bag with sharp objects to prevent it from breaking. Now let's make our own cold drinks!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gtIG4ILBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SeoTin","source_asin":"B0BR9T4SS1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253768","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR9T4SS1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR9T4SS1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":253769,"name":"Carlisle FoodService Products 564207 Alibi Shatter-Resistant Plastic Red Wine Glass, 20 oz (Set of 24)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":142.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zkmn0ZRkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Carlisle 564207 Alibi set contains 24 clear, shatterproof red wine glasses for poolside, resorts, or other outdoor environments where breakage is a concern. This stemware is made of polycarbonate for high impact resistance. It has a sturdy base for reducing spills. It has a 20-oz. capacity and is dishwasher-safe. This red wine glass has a 2.75\" top diameter, a 3.25\" base diameter, and is 9.00\" in height. Carlisle manufactures food service equipment and supplies and sanitary maintenance tools and supplies for commercial, industrial, and institutional facilities. The company, founded in 1954, is headquartered in Oklahoma City, OK.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zkmn0ZRkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carlisle FoodService Products","source_asin":"B0C348BZ95","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253769","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C348BZ95","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C348BZ95","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":253770,"name":"Fully Assembled Birthday Photo Booth Props. 30 Piece Box Set of Black & Gold Selfie Party Supplies and Decorations Kit with Real Glitter Cute Bday Des","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vcw-esYjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FULLY ASSEMBLED = NO WASTED TIME GLUING THEM TOGETHER 🌟 Your black and gold birthday photo booth props will arrive to you in a sturdy box, already pre-assembled onto thick 9.5 inch wooden sticks. All you have to do is take them out of the box and you’re ready to go! We also include 30 glue dots that are optional to use in case you want to add even more support. We’ve seen many of our customers use the glue dots to add a few of the props to their walls as added party decor! PRETTY DESIGNS MAKE YOUR PARTY AND PHOTOS STAND OUT 🌟 We put a lot of thought into designing each photo prop ourselves to ensure that every sign was super cute and perfect for your birthday party. They work well in pictures (of course!), as centerpieces, or wall decor. STURDY CARDSTOCK AND STICKS WILL LAST ALL PARTY LONG 🌟 Our birthday props are made of 350 gsm card stock, which means they are thick. This high quality means they can hold up to being used all night long (plus they come packaged in a box that you can store them in to re-use for future parties if you'd like). The dowels we used are made of thick quality wood, so they won’t break or fray. SET OF 30 MEANS LOTS OF (CUTE) OPTIONS 🌟 Our large set of 30 props includes plenty of options for everyone to choose from. We didn’t just throw together a bunch of random props out there though. We made sure they all coordinated and included a good mix of sayings, cute hats and glasses, and fun signs/props unique to a birthday party! There are so many options that everyone will find plenty they want to use! REAL GLITTER ADDS REAL SPARKLE TO YOUR PARTY 🌟 The real gold glitter that sets us apart from other photo booth kits will set your birthday celebration apart too! The no DIY birthday signs save you time and add that extra touch to elevate your party!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vcw-esYjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Perfect Occasion","source_asin":"B0848QXT35","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253770","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0848QXT35","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0848QXT35","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
