window.products.push({"id":253840,"name":"WIRIST Super Absorbent Bath Mats for Bathroom Non Slip, Stylish Embossed Bath Mats, Machine Washable Bathroom Mats (Stripe Pattern, Gray 23.6\" L X 15.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WDGAQnWcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🇺🇸【SKIN FRIENDLY & STYLISH】: These bathroom mats’ surfaces are made of improved technology of dense and short fuzzy fibers materials, which make them skin friendly, soft and cozy. These new bath mats for bathroom non slip can give you a comfortable and soft feeling for your wet feet after your shower instead of stepping on the slippery and cold tiles. And this super absorbent bath mat embosses the unique geometric patterns which make your bathroom space looks more exquisite and stylish. 🇺🇸【SUPER ABSORBENT BATH MAT】: These bath mats are made of 4 layers: technical fiber, regenerated sponge, diatomite foam, non-slip rubber. Three layers (except rubber layer) would provide three times water absorption than other normal polyester or polypropylene bath mats for bathroom non slip. These bathroom mats will make water be absorbed extreme quickly that you will see water droplets disappear very quickly on the surface. Moreover, short fuzzy fibers dry remarkably fast. 🇺🇸【ULTRA ANTI-SLIP & DURABLE】: Great bath mats can help avoid from slipping or falling down. Waterproof rubber of back prevents water from penetrating to the floor. This non-slip layer ensures won’t crumple when you step on or passing, it can stay in place even on very wet or slippery tiles or floors. <br> Moreover, one outstanding point is the edge sealing which shows the high quality & durable. It won’t be smelly or washed out after long-term use. It is machine washable. 🇺🇸【MUTIPLE USAGE】: Since only 0.27 inch thick, it’s thin enough to fit under any doors to open and close. Proper thickness for robot vacuum cleaner or wheel chair, no need to worry about tripping. These bath mats for bathroom non slip have unique and classic patterns which can go with any décors and add style. Be widely used in various places in your home: bathroom, living room, laundry, doors or stairs entry etc. Also could be a great choice of exquisite small gifts for friends. 🇺🇸【TWO SIZE CHOICES】: This super absorbent bath mat has two size to choose: (1) Small Size: 23.6”x15.7”inches; (2) Medium Size: 31.5”x19.7”inches. The Small Size is perfect for small spaces of bathroom, such as under single sink or out of single shower room. The Medium Size is perfect for bathroom which has bigger spaces (compared to small bathroom), such as under double sinks or bathtub. You could choose the right size according to the space & structure of your bathroom before purchasing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WDGAQnWcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WIRIST","source_asin":"B0BVGL7ZNF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVGL7ZNF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVGL7ZNF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
