window.products.push({"id":253895,"name":"Combler Ice Molds, Ice Cube Tray for Freezer, 2 Inch Large Ice Cube Molds for Cocktails Whiskey Bourbon, Diamond Ice Ball Maker Mold, Round Ice Cube M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CvNtcyEoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE DIAMOND BALL SHAPE ICE CUBE TRAY: Combler large ice cube molds for cocktails can make 4pcs 2 inches large diamond ice balls. Impress your guests and add a touch of elegance to your whiskey with this captivating diamond ice ball maker mold. SLOW MELTING FOR COCKTAILS & Whiskey: These large ice spheres melt slowly to keep your drinks cold. Perfect to chill cocktails, whiskey, Bourbon, Scotch tequila, or other drinks with less dilution. This round sphere ice cube mold is also great for DIY popsicles, jellies, and fruit and vegetable ice cubes. FOOD GRADE MATERIAL: Package includes 2pcs food-grade PET ice cube trays for freezer, 1 food-grade PEVA storage bag, and 1 stainless steel ice tong. This round ice cube mold is durable, BPA-free, and odorless. These Combler ice molds for whiskey are suitable for temperatures ranging from -40°F to 167°F. Hand wash only! EASY TO USE: Follow these simple steps to make the perfect diamond ice ball: 1) Fill the bottom mold with water up to 2/3 full. 2) Push down the ice mold’s lid slowly. Let the spill-out water leave on the lid. (Prevent the cover float.) 3) Freeze for at least 12 hours. 4) Allow it to thaw naturally for a few minutes. (DO NOT pour warm water, avoid the ice cube breakage.) Open the mold with both hands and twist it gently to release the ice ball. Welcome to show your perfect ice ball or share your making experience. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE: These ice trays for freezer with lid are packaged in a thick carton box to prevent damage during transportation. If you are not 100% satisfied with the ice tray, please contact us, and we will provide a satisfactory solution for you. Combler whiskey ice mold will be the perfect gifts for any cocktail enthusiast.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CvNtcyEoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Combler","source_asin":"B0C2MX7N6K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-253895","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2MX7N6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2MX7N6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
